        <p class="mt-4 text-muted max-w-xl">Pick your tool, copy the code and run it. There is nothing to sign up for.</p>

        <div class="panel mt-8 grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)] lg:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
          <div class="border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r hairline p-3 lg:p-5">
            <div role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" aria-label="Request examples" id="example-tabs" class="vtabs flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:flex-col lg:flex-nowrap lg:gap-2.5">
              <div role="presentation" class="hidden lg:block px-1 pt-5 pb-0.5 text-sm text-muted first:pt-0">JavaScript</div>
